# Doctor: the checks the daemon ran, the equipment of the machine and the warning for a second way to werkbuch.
Output ".vhs/doctor.gif"
Source "docs/tapes/config.tape"

Hide
Type "werkbuch-runner" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "3"
Sleep 2s
Down 7
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 300ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/doctor.png"
Sleep 300ms
